--- !u!114 &2086637629
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2086637626}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bd8247e9fc96a7f4c95b91b320ab5883, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcDialogue
  storyStates:
  - minimumStoryBeat: 0
    location: {fileID: 1279110320}
    isVisible: 1
    isInteractable: 1
    lines:
    - speaker: Alan
      text: Hey! Sorry to bother you, but do you know where the tech support room
        is? They gave me a map, but there's so many floors and unmarked sections
        that it makes no sense to me.
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: 'Oh, sorry, it''s the first day for me too. '
    - speaker: Alan
      text: Hey Emily! I told you! We've got another one!
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: What's that about?
    - speaker: Alan
      text: We were arguing about what's going on. It seems like they must hire in
        batches, because everyone I've spoken to today are all newbies, too.
    - speaker: Alan
      text: But surely someone around here must know what's going on?
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: Well, did you get the orientation at least?
    - speaker: Alan
      text: Yeah, I met the director. Pryce. You?
    - speaker: Cyrus
      text: Yeah, it seemed like he had the lay of the land.
    - speaker: Alan
      text: 'Sure, in an unbalanced kind of way. But I guess that''s what you get
        with all this high tech mystery. '
    - speaker: Alan
      text: Anyway, if you figure out where the tech room is, let me know!
    storyBeatAfterDialogue: 0
  - minimumStoryBeat: 3
    location: {fileID: 1096157811}
    isVisible: 1
    isInteractable: 0
    lines: []
    storyBeatAfterDialogue: 0
